### TeamForge Phase 1 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Moderation Core: Warnings, Suspensions, Reactivations, and Reputation

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@collaboratorToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE
@targetUserId = 2

### 1. Issue Warning to User (Success)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: User details with warningsCount incremented, warning logged, and reputation decreased by 10
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/warn
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Repeated disruptive comments in project discussion"
}

###

### 2. Issue Warning - Missing/Invalid Token
# Expected Status: 401 Unauthorized
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 401, "error": "UNAUTHORIZED", "code": "UNAUTHORIZED", "message": "Missing or invalid Authorization Bearer token." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/warn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Repeated disruptive comments in project discussion"
}

###

### 3. Issue Warning - Forbidden (Non-Admin Role)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "FORBIDDEN", "code": "FORBIDDEN", "message": "You do not have the required permissions to access this resource." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/warn
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{collaboratorToken}}

{
  "reason": "Repeated disruptive comments in project discussion"
}

###

### 4. Issue Warning - Validation Failure (Explanation < 10 Chars)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 400, "error": "BAD_REQUEST", "code": "EXPLANATION_TOO_SHORT", "message": "Explanation must be at least 10 characters." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/warn
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "bad act"
}

###

### 5. Suspend User (Success)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: User details with status "suspended", tasks returned to unassigned, owned projects closed, mentor paid/refunded
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/suspend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Violating community guidelines and harassment policy"
}

###

### 6. Suspend User - Validation Failure (Explanation < 10 Chars)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 400, "error": "BAD_REQUEST", "code": "EXPLANATION_TOO_SHORT", "message": "Explanation must be at least 10 characters." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/suspend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "short"
}

###

### 7. Reactivate Suspended User (Success)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: User details with status "active", activeWarningsCount reset to 0, notification sent
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "User completed remediation review and appeal accepted"
}

###

### 8. Reactivate User - Validation Failure (Explanation < 10 Chars)
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 400, "error": "BAD_REQUEST", "code": "EXPLANATION_TOO_SHORT", "message": "Explanation must be at least 10 characters." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "reactivate"
}

###

### 9. Moderate User Status Endpoint (Success)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: User details updated to requested status
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "suspended",
  "reason": "Suspending account pending deeper administrative review"
}

###

### 10. Query User Warnings (Admin View)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Array of warnings, newest first, with moderator name
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/warnings
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

###

### 11. Query Own Warnings (User View)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: Array of own warnings with N/4 labels
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/warnings
Authorization: {{collaboratorToken}}

###

### 12. Self-Moderation Attempt (Forbidden)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "FORBIDDEN", "code": "CANNOT_MODERATE_SELF", "message": "You cannot moderate your own account." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/u-admin/warn
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Attempting to moderate self"
}

###

### 13. Admin Moderation Attempt (Forbidden)
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 403, "error": "FORBIDDEN", "code": "CANNOT_MODERATE_ADMIN", "message": "You cannot moderate an administrator or superuser account." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/u-superuser/warn
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Attempting to moderate super user"
}

###

### 14. Apply to Closed Project (Conflict)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Response: { "statusCode": 409, "error": "CONFLICT", "code": "PROJECT_CLOSED", "message": "This project is closed and no longer accepts applications." }
POST {{baseUrl}}/join-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{collaboratorToken}}

{
  "projectId": "proj-2",
  "role": "Frontend Developer",
  "message": "Applying to a closed project"
}

###
